      "description": "Narcissism (16-item version). Score = number of narcissistic statements chosen across the 8 forced-choice items (narcissistic option scored 1), range 0-8; higher = more narcissistic. (This harvested version presents 8 of the NPI forced-choice pairs.)",
      "name": "NPI Narcissism Scoring",
      "status": "validated"
    }
